{
    "title": "Baby Panda Care",
    "description": "Do you want to know how to take care of a baby? Try Baby Panda Care to learn! Take care of babies at different stages (swaddling - crawling - learning to walk) and help them grow up healthy. \r\n\r\nFEEDING BABIES\r\nWhat kinds of baby foods are there? Milk powder, rice cereal, biscuits, and pureed vegetables! These foods are nutritious for babies. Feed babies food that is appropriate for their development stage! \r\n\r\nPLAYING WITH BABIES\r\nIt's time for activities. What do babies like to play? Dress-up and block stacking? How about hide-and-seek and sandcastle building? Experience 20+ interesting activities in the various corners. Come and explore! \r\n\r\nPUTTING BABIES TO SLEEP\r\nThe babies are sleepy. Let's take them to the bathroom for their bath! Let's soap up, rinse off, and get ready for bed! Play a lullaby and gently swing their cradles to put them to sleep! \r\n\r\nLook! The babies are asleep. You've done a great job taking care of them today! \r\n\r\nFEATURES: \r\n- Take care of baby boys & girls;\r\n- See them grow up in three stages: swaddling, crawling, and learning to walk;\r\n- 20+ fun interactions to help improve kids' hands-on skills, reflexes, and more;\r\n- Dress up the babies in six sets of adorable clothes;\r\n- Learn baby care skills: feed the babies, bathe them, and put them to sleep; \r\n- Learn to care for others and develop a sense of responsibility.\r\n\r\nAbout BabyBus\r\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\r\nAt BabyBus, we dedicate ourselves to sparking kids' creativity, imagination and curiosity,and designing our products through the kids' perspective to help them explore the world on their own.\r\n\r\nNow BabyBus offers a wide variety of products, videos and other educational content for over 600 million fans from ages 0-8 around the world! We have released over 200 children's apps, over 2500 episodes of nursery rhymes and animations, over 9000 stories  of various themes spanning the Health, Language, Society, Science, Art and other fields.\r\n\r\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\r\nContact us: ser@babybus.com\r\nVisit us: http://www.babybus.com",
    "descriptionHTML": "Do you want to know how to take care of a baby? Try Baby Panda Care to learn! Take care of babies at different stages (swaddling - crawling - learning to walk) and help them grow up healthy. <br><br>FEEDING BABIES<br>What kinds of baby foods are there? Milk powder, rice cereal, biscuits, and pureed vegetables! These foods are nutritious for babies. Feed babies food that is appropriate for their development stage! <br><br>PLAYING WITH BABIES<br>It&#39;s time for activities. What do babies like to play? Dress-up and block stacking? How about hide-and-seek and sandcastle building? Experience 20+ interesting activities in the various corners. Come and explore! <br><br>PUTTING BABIES TO SLEEP<br>The babies are sleepy. Let&#39;s take them to the bathroom for their bath! Let&#39;s soap up, rinse off, and get ready for bed! Play a lullaby and gently swing their cradles to put them to sleep! <br><br>Look! The babies are asleep. You&#39;ve done a great job taking care of them today! <br><br>FEATURES: <br>- Take care of baby boys &amp; girls;<br>- See them grow up in three stages: swaddling, crawling, and learning to walk;<br>- 20+ fun interactions to help improve kids&#39; hands-on skills, reflexes, and more;<br>- Dress up the babies in six sets of adorable clothes;<br>- Learn baby care skills: feed the babies, bathe them, and put them to sleep; <br>- Learn to care for others and develop a sense of responsibility.<br><br>About BabyBus<br>\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014<br>At BabyBus, we dedicate ourselves to sparking kids&#39; creativity, imagination and curiosity,and designing our products through the kids&#39; perspective to help them explore the world on their own.<br><br>Now BabyBus offers a wide variety of products, videos and other educational content for over 600 million fans from ages 0-8 around the world! We have released over 200 children&#39;s apps, over 2500 episodes of nursery rhymes and animations, over 9000 stories  of various themes spanning the Health, Language, Society, Science, Art and other fields.<br><br>\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014<br>Contact us: ser@babybus.com<br>Visit us: http://www.babybus.com",
